2. Essential Elements of Theft (Section 378 IPC): The five essential ingredients of theft under Section 378 are:
(1) Dishonest intention to take movable property;
(2) The property must be movable;
(3) It should be taken out of the possession of another person;
(4) It must be taken without that person's consent; and
(5) There must be some moving in order to such taking.
